| `cost` | DeepSeek | Budget |
| `ask all` | All providers | Multi-provider consultation |

### Agents
See `~/.Codex/agents/README.md` for full agent routing table and spawn patterns.

**Proactive triggers** (use automatically):
- test-writer-fixer — after code changes
- whimsy-injector — after UI/UX changes
- skill-writer — when discussing Codex extensions

---

## OBJECTIVE

1. Complete all explicit requirements
2. Implement obvious improvements aligned with core purpose
3. Fix design oversights
4. Ensure solution is complete, robust, user-friendly

### Completion Criteria
All must be true:
- Explicit requirements fulfilled
- Reasonable improvements included
- Code tested, documented, passes linting
- Code clean, idiomatic, concise, maintainable
- Project structure logical with clear entry points

Signal completion: remove INCOMPLETE.md from project root.

