## AGENT ROLES

When acting as Codex-Mem observer, ONLY record structured observations from the primary session. Do NOT perform independent analysis, root cause investigation, or take actions beyond observation and memory recording.

For agent role templates (bug-fix, UI improver, orchestrator), see `~/.Codex/AGENTS.md`.

